  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "10.2.0: BREAKING: no longer depends on Jakar.Extensions or Jakar.Files (Serilog, Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions/Options and System.IO.Hashing only). The Jakar.Extensions parts moved to the new Jakar.Logging.Serilog: LogEventProperties (AppInformation/ThreadInformation/GcInfo/DeviceInformation properties), DeviceInformationEnricher, OpenTelemetryActivityEnricher (app and device properties from a TelemetrySource) and AppLoggerOptions.CreateLogger(TelemetrySource). Here: ActivityEnricher (spans, plus thread and GC state from RuntimeProperties on warnings) replaces OpenTelemetryActivityEnricher; IOpenTelemetryActivityEnricher is gone. AppLoggerOptions is no longer a BaseClass or disposable, has no DeviceInfo/Info, uses string paths (AppDataDirectory, CacheDirectory, LogsDirectory, SeqBuffer, LogsFile, ScreenshotFile) instead of LocalDirectory/FilePaths, CreateLogger(Action<LoggerConfiguration>?) replaces CreateLogger(TelemetrySource), and ConfigureLogger no longer takes a TelemetrySource; the folder/template constants are on AppLoggerOptions. ScreenShot.File is a path. Enricher lost its AppVersion/GcGenerationInformation overloads. 10.1.0: initial release. Split out of Jakar.Extensions 10.12.0; the types keep the Jakar.Extensions namespace.",
